    "description": "Objective\n\nMake status and market instantly scannable in list views and on the record.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Status emojis per the agreed colorway: In Progress = yellow; Completed = green; Archived = gray; Fraud = red/triangle\n\n* New = pending final selection from Lina\n\n* Country flag emojis driven by formula fields — no Rep input\n\n* Working set in use: New / In Progress / Completed / Archived / Flagged\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Status emoji renders everywhere status is displayed\n\n* Country flag derives automatically from market/country data\n\nOpen Questions\n\n* New status emoji still outstanding from Lina. Carried as a note rather than reopening this ticket.\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nDA emoji colorway also applied to Deal Rep Assignment list views under BUILD-45 (Doc #31).\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 21.",
